     <div class=\"mb-3\">\n            <label class=\"form-label fw-bold text-navy\">Search Medicine or Batch</label>\n            <div class=\"input-group input-group-lg shadow-sm\">\n              <span class=\"input-group-text bg-white border-end-0 text-muted\">\n                <i class=\"fas fa-search\"></i>\n              </span>\n              <input\n                type=\"text\"\n                id=\"verifyInput\"\n                class=\"form-control border-start-0 ps-0\"\n                placeholder=\"Enter medicine name, generic, manufacturer, batch number or barcode...\"\n                required\n              >\n              <button class=\"btn btn-primary-custom px-4\" type=\"submit\" id=\"verifySearchBtn\">\n                <i class=\"fas fa-search me-2\"></i>Verify Medicine\n              </button>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center justify-content-between gap-2 mt-3\">\n            <div class=\"small text-muted\">\n              <i class=\"fas fa-lightbulb text-warning me-1\"></i> Quick Test:\n              <a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" onclick=\"document.getElementById('verifyInput').value='Napa 500 mg'; executeVerification('Napa 500 mg');\" class=\"text-decoration-none me-2\">Napa 500 mg</a>\n              <a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" onclick=\"document.getElementById('verifyInput').value='Seclo 20 mg'; executeVerification('Seclo 20 mg');\" class=\"text-decoration-none me-2\">Seclo 20 mg</a>\n              <a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" onclick=\"document.getElementById('verifyInput').value='NAPA-EXP-26'; executeVerification('NAPA-EXP-26');\" class=\"text-decoration-none me-2 text-warning\">Near Expiry Batch</a>\n              <a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" onclick=\"document.getElementById('verifyInput').value='ACE-FLAG-88'; executeVerification('ACE-FLAG-88');\" class=\"text-decoration-none text-danger\">Reported Batch</a>\n            </div>\n\n            <div>\n              <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm\" onclick=\"simulateBarcodeScan('894110000101')\">\n                <i class=\"fas fa-barcode me-1\"></i> Scan Barcode\n              </button>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </form>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Verification Results Area -->\n      <div id=\"verifyResultArea\" style=\"max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n        <!-- Initial Guidance Card -->\n        <div class=\"text-center py-5 bg-white rounded-4 border p-4 shadow-sm\">\n          <div class=\"mb-3 text-primary opacity-75\">\n            <i class=\"fas fa-clipboard-check fa-3x\"></i>\n          </div>\n          <h5 class=\"fw-bold text-navy\">Ready to Verify</h5>\n          <p class=\"text-muted small max-w-500 mx-auto mb-3\">\n            Type any Bangladesh medicine brand (e.g. Napa, Seclo, Maxpro, Sergel) or batch code to inspect verification status and nearby verified pharmacy stock.\n          </p>\n          <div class=\"d-flex justify-content-center gap-3\">\n            <span class=\"badge bg-success bg-opacity-10 text-success border border-success border-opacity-25 px-3 py-2\">\n              <i class=\"fas fa-check-circle me-1\"></i> Database Match\n            </span>\n            <span class=\"badge bg-warning bg-opacity-10 text-warning border border-warning border-opacity-25 px-3 py-2\">\n              <i class=\"fas fa-exclamation-circle me-1\"></i> Needs Review\n            </span>\n            <span class=\"badge bg-danger bg-opacity-10 text-danger border border-danger border-opacity-25 px-3 py-2\">\n              <i class=\"fas fa-times-circle me-1\"></i> Alert / Not Found\n            </span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n\n  <!-- Dynamic Footer -->\n  <div id=\"mainFooter\"></div>\n\n  <!-- Scripts -->\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js\"></script>\n  <script src=\"js/main.js\"></script>\n  <script src=\"js/auth.js\"></script>\n  <script src=\"js/verify.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>\n","Description":"Create Medicine Verification page (verify.html) with search and barcode scan simulation","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\User\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\medcheck-bd\\client\\verify.html","toolAction":"Create client/verify.html","toolSummary":"Create verify.html"}}]}
{"step_index":92,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-10T12:59:43Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-10T18:59:43+06:00\nCompleted At: 2026-09-10T18:59:43+06:00\nCreated file file:///C:/Users/User/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/medcheck-bd/client/verify.html with requested content.\nIf relevant, proactively run terminal commands to execute this code for the USER. Don't ask for permission."}
{"step_index":93,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-10T12:59:43Z","thinking":"**Designing Medicine Details Page**\n\nPlanning the structure of the `medicine-details.html` page, deciding on content sections. The required sections include basic, regulatory, batch, and price information, with each section having defined data points. This layout facilitates presenting comprehensive medicine information in an organized manner.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Medicine Details - MedCheck BD</title>\n  <link href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <link href=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"css/style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <!-- Dynamic Navbar -->\n  <div id=\"mainNavbar\"></div>\n\n  <main class=\"py-5\">\n    <div class=\"container\" style=\"max-width: 960px;\">\n      <!-- Breadcrumb -->\n      <nav aria-label=\"breadcrumb\" class=\"mb-4\">\n        <ol class=\"breadcrumb\">\n          <li class=\"breadcrumb-item\"><a href=\"index.html\">Home</a></li>\n          <li class=\"breadcrumb-item\"><a href=\"verify.html\">Verification</a></li>\n          <li class=\"breadcrumb-item active\" aria-current=\"page\">Medicine Details</li>\n        </ol>\n      </nav>\n\n      <div id=\"medicineDetailsArea\">\n        <div class=\"text-center py-5\">\n          <div class=\"spinner-border text-primary\" role=\"status\"></div>\n          <p class=\"text-muted mt-2\">Loading medicine profile...</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n\n  <!-- Dynamic Footer -->\n  <div id=\"mainFooter\"></div>\n\n  <!-- Scripts -->\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js\"></script>\n  <script src=\"js/main.js\"></script>\n  <script src=\"js/auth.js\"></script>\n  <script>\n    document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', async () => {\n      const urlParams = new URLSearchParams(window.location.search);\n      const medicineId = urlParams.get('id');\n      const container = document.getElementById('medicineDetailsArea');\n\n      if (!medicineId) {\n        container.innerHTML = `\n          <div class=\"alert alert-warning\">\n            No medicine selected. Please search for a medicine on the <a href=\"verify.html\">Verification Page</a>.\n          </div>\n        `;\n        return;\n      }\n\n      try {\n        const res = await fetch(`/api/medicines/${medicineId}`);\n        const data = await res.json();\n\n        if (!data.success || !data.data) {\n          throw new Error(data.message || 'Medicine not found');\n        }\n\n        const med = data.data;\n        const batches = med.batches || [];\n\n        let alertsHtml = '';\n        if (med.alerts && med.alerts.length > 0) {\n          alertsHtml = `\n            <div class=\"alert alert-danger border-0 mb-4 shadow-sm\">\n              <h6 class=\"fw-bold mb-2\"><i class=\"fas fa-exclamation-triangle me-2\"></i>Active Health Warnings / Alerts:</h6>\n              <ul class=\"mb-0 ps-3\">\n                ${med.alerts.map(a => `<li><strong>${a.alertType}:</strong> ${a.message}</li>`).join('')}\n              </ul>\n            </div>\n          `;\n        }\n\n        let batchesRows = '<tr><td colspan=\"5\" class=\"text-muted text-center py-3\">No registered batch records found.</td></tr>';\n        if (batches.length > 0) {\n          batchesRows = batches.map(b => {\n            let pillClass = 'match';\n            if (b.computedStatus === 'EXPIRING_SOON') pillClass = 'review';\n            if (b.computedStatus === 'EXPIRED' || b.computedStatus === 'SUSPICIOUS' || b.computedStatus === 'RECALLED') pillClass = 'alert';\n\n            return `\n              <tr>\n                <td class=\"font-monospace fw-bold\">${b.batchNumber}</td>\n                <td>${formatDate(b.manufacturingDate)}</td>\n                <td>${formatDate(b.expiryDate)}</td>\n                <td><span class=\"status-pill ${pillClass}\">${b.computedStatus}</span></td>\n                <td>${b.reportedCounterfeitCount > 0 ? `<span class=\"badge bg-danger\">${b.reportedCounterfeitCount} Discrepancies Reported</span>` : '<span class=\"text-success small\">Clean Record</span>'}</td>\n              </tr>\n            `;\n          }).join('');\n        }\n\n        container.innerHTML = `\n          <div class=\"card-custom p-4 mb-4\">\n            <div class=\"d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center justify-content-between gap-3 mb-4 border-bottom pb-4\">\n              <div>\n                <span class=\"status-pill ${med.registrationStatus === 'REGISTERED' ? 'registered' : 'review'} mb-2\">\n                  <i class=\"fas fa-check-circle me-1\"></i> ${med.registrationStatus}\n                </span>\n                <h2 class=\"fw-bold text-navy mb-1\">${med.name}</h2>\n                <div class=\"text-secondary fs-5\">${med.genericName} • ${med.strength}</div>\n                <div class=\"text-muted small mt-1\">Manufacturer: <strong>${med.manufacturer}</strong></div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"text-lg-end\">\n                <span class=\"text-muted small d-block\">DGDA Benchmark Reference Price</span>\n                <span class=\"fs-2 fw-bold text-primary\">${formatBDT(med.referencePrice)}</span>\n                <span class=\"text-muted small d-block\">per ${med.dosageForm}</span>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            ${alertsHtml}\n\n            <!-- Basic & Regulatory Information -->\n            <div class=\"row g-4 mb-4\">\n              <div class=\"col-md-6\">\n                <h5 class=\"fw-bold text-navy mb-3\"><i class=\"fas fa-pills text-primary me-2\"></i>Basic Information</h5>\n                <div class=\"result-detail-row\">\n                  <span class=\"result-detail-label\">Brand Name</span>\n                  <span class=\"result-detail-value\">${med.name}</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"result-detail-row\">\n                  <span class=\"result-detail-label\">Generic Name</span>\n                  <span class=\"result-detail-value\">${med.genericName}</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"result-detail-row\">\n                  <span class=\"result-detail-label\">Manufacturer</span>\n                  <span class=\"result-detail-value\">${med.manufacturer}</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"result-detail-row\">\n                  <span class=\"result-detail-label\">Dosage Form</span>\n                  <span class=\"result-detail-value\">${med.dosageForm}</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"result-detail-row\">\n                  <span class=\"result-detail-label\">Strength</span>\n                  <span class=\"result-detail-value\">${med.strength}</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"result-detail-row\">\n                  <span class=\"result-detail-label\">Therapeutic Category</span>\n                  <span class=\"result-detail-value\">${med.category}</span>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n\n              <div class=\"col-md-6\">\n                <h5 class=\"fw-bold text-navy mb-3\"><i class=\"fas fa-balance-scale text-success me-2\"></i>Regulatory Information</h5>\n                <div class=\"result-detail-row\">\n                  <span class=\"result-detail-label\">Registration Status</span>\n                  <span class=\"status-pill ${med.registrationStatus === 'REGISTERED' ? 'registered' : 'review'}\">${med.registrationStatus}</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"result-detail-row\">\n                  <span class=\"result-detail-label\">DGDA DAR Reference No</span>\n                  <span class=\"result-detail-value font-monospace\">${med.registrationNumber}</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"result-detail-row\">\n                  <span class=\"result-detail-label\">Barcode / GTIN</span>\n                  <span class=\"result-detail-value font-monospace\">${med.barcode || 'N/A'}</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"result-detail-row\">\n                  <span class=\"result-detail-label\">Data Source</span>\n                  <span class=\"result-detail-value\">MedCheck BD Verified Registry</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"result-detail-row\">\n                  <span class=\"result-detail-label\">Last Updated</span>\n                  <span class=\"result-detail-value\">${formatDate(med.updatedAt)}</span>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Description / Clinical Info -->\n            <div class=\"p-3 bg-light rounded-3 mb-4\">\n              <h6 class=\"fw-bold text-navy mb-2\"><i class=\"fas fa-info-circle text-primary me-2\"></i>Indications & Overview</h6>\n              <p class=\"small text-secondary mb-0\">\n                ${med.description || 'Standard therapeutic product used under clinical direction by licensed healthcare practitioners.'}\n              </p>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Batch Registry Table -->\n            <div class=\"mb-4\">\n              <h5 class=\"fw-bold text-navy mb-3\"><i class=\"fas fa-boxes text-primary me-2\"></i>Registered Batches & Expiry Dates</h5>\n              <div class=\"table-responsive\">\n                <table class=\"table table-custom align-middle\">\n                  <thead>\n                    <tr>\n                      <th>Batch Number</th>\n                      <th>Mfg Date</th>\n                      <th>Exp Date</th>\n                      <th>Batch Status</th>\n                      <th>Audit History</th>\n                    </tr>\n                  </thead>\n                  <tbody>\n                    ${batchesRows}\n                  </tbody>\n                </table>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Actions -->\n            <div class=\"d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 pt-3 border-top justify-content-between align-items-center\">\n              <div class=\"d-flex gap-2\">\n                <a href=\"price.html?medicine=${encodeURIComponent(med.name)}\" class=\"btn btn-primary-custom btn-sm\">\n                  <i class=\"fas fa-tags me-1\"></i> Compare Pharmacy Prices\n                </a>\n                <a href=\"pharmacies.html?medicine=${encodeURIComponent(med.name)}\" class=\"btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm\">\n                  <i class=\"fas fa-store me-1\"></i> Locate In Pharmacies\n                </a>\n              </div>\n              <a href=\"report.html?medicine=${encodeURIComponent(med.name)}\" class=\"btn btn-outline-danger btn-sm\">\n                <i class=\"fas fa-flag me-1\"></i> Report a Suspicious Medicine\n              </a>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        `;\n      } catch (err) {\n        container.innerHTML = `<div class=\"alert alert-danger\">${err.message}</div>`;\n      }\n    });\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>\n","Description":"Create Medicine Details page (medicine-details.html) with regulatory, batch, price and alert information","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\User\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\medcheck-bd\\client\\medicine-details.html","toolAction":"Create client/medicine-details.html","toolSummary":"Create medicine-details.html"}}]}
{"step_index":94,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-10T12:59:52Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-10T18:59:52+06:00\nCompleted At: 2026-09-10T18:59:52+06:00\nCreated file file:///C:/Users/User/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/medcheck-bd/client/medicine-details.html with requested content.\nIf relevant, proactively run terminal commands to execute this code for the USER. Don't ask for permission."}
{"step_index":95,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-10T12:59:52Z","thinking":"**Designing the price comparison page**\n\nCreating `client/price.html` to display medicine prices. The page needs a heading \"Medicine Price Check\", a search function, and a table showing pharmacy, medicine, price, update, and status. It must highlight the lowest price and display reference price, user price, and the price difference.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Medicine Price Check - MedCheck BD</title>\n  <link href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <link href=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"css/style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <!-- Dynamic Navbar -->\n  <div id=\"mainNavbar\"></div>\n\n  <main class=\"py-5\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <!-- Header -->\n      <div class=\"text-center max-w-700 mx-auto mb-5\">\n        <span class=\"badge bg-success bg-opacity-10 text-success fw-bold text-uppercase px-3 py-2 rounded-pill mb-2\">\n          <i class=\"fas fa-coins me-1\"></i> Fair Retail Pricing & Transparency\n        </span>\n        <h1 class=\"fw-bold text-navy\">Medicine Price Check</h1>\n        <p class=\"text-muted\">\n          Compare verified pharmacy retail rates against official DGDA reference prices. Find the lowest cost options in your neighborhood.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Search Box -->\n      <div class=\"card-custom p-4 mb-5 mx-auto\" style=\"max-width: 800px;\">\n        <form onsubmit=\"handlePriceSearch(event)\">\n          <label class=\"form-label fw-bold text-navy\">Search Medicine for Price Comparison</label>\n          <div class=\"input-group input-group-lg shadow-sm\">\n            <span class=\"input-group-text bg-white border-end-0 text-muted\"><i class=\"fas fa-tags\"></i></span>\n            <input\n              type=\"text\"\n              id=\"priceSearchInput\"\n              class=\"form-control border-start-0 ps-0\"\n              placeholder=\"e.g. Napa 500 mg, Seclo 20 mg, Maxpro 20 mg...\"\n              required\n            >\n            <button class=\"btn btn-primary-custom px-4\" type=\"submit\" id=\"priceSearchBtn\">\n              <i class=\"fas fa-search me-2\"></i>Check Prices\n            </button>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"small text-muted mt-2\">\n            <i class=\"fas fa-lightbulb text-warning me-1\"></i> Suggestions:\n            <a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" onclick=\"searchPriceFor('Napa 500 mg')\" class=\"text-decoration-none me-2\">Napa 500 mg</a>\n            <a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" onclick=\"searchPriceFor('Seclo 20 mg')\" class=\"text-decoration-none me-2\">Seclo 20 mg</a>\n            <a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" onclick=\"searchPriceFor('Maxpro 20 mg')\" class=\"text-decoration-none me-2\">Maxpro 20 mg</a>\n            <a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" onclick=\"searchPriceFor('Ace Plus')\" class=\"text-decoration-none\">Ace Plus</a>\n          </div>\n        </form>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Price Comparison Results Area -->\n      <div id=\"priceComparisonArea\" class=\"mx-auto\" style=\"max-width: 960px;\">\n        <div class=\"text-center py-5 bg-white rounded-4 border p-4 shadow-sm\">\n          <div class=\"text-success opacity-75 mb-3\">\n            <i class=\"fas fa-chart-line fa-3x\"></i>\n          </div>\n          <h5 class=\"fw-bold text-navy\">Search Any Medicine to Compare Prices</h5>\n          <p class=\"text-muted small max-w-500 mx-auto\">\n            Discover which pharmacies in Dhaka, Dhanmondi, Mirpur, Uttara and divisional hubs offer the best rates within official DGDA guidelines.\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Disclaimer -->\n      <div class=\"alert alert-light border text-muted small mt-5 mx-auto\" style=\"max-width: 960px;\">\n        <i class=\"fas fa-info-circle text-primary me-2\"></i>\n        <strong>Price Disclaimer:</strong> Prices may vary by pharmacy and location. Displayed prices reflect live inventory data submitted by registered pharmacies and reference/demo benchmarks. Always request a printed receipt from your dispensing pharmacy.\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n\n  <!-- Dynamic Footer -->\n  <div id=\"mainFooter\"></div>\n\n  <!-- Scripts -->\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js\"></script>\n  <script src=\"js/main.js\"></script>\n  <script src=\"js/auth.js\"></script>\n  <script>\n    document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n      const urlParams = new URLSearchParams(window.location.search);\n      const medicine = urlParams.get('medicine');\n      if (medicine) {\n        const input = document.getElementById('priceSearchInput');\n        if (input) input.value = decodeURIComponent(medicine);\n        executePriceCheck(medicine);\n      }\n    });\n\n    function searchPriceFor(name) {\n      document.getElementById('priceSearchInput').value = name;\n      executePriceCheck(name);\n    }\n\n    function handlePriceSearch(e) {\n      e.preventDefault();\n      const query = document.getElementById('priceSearchInput').value.trim();\n      if (!query) return;\n      executePriceCheck(query);\n    }\n\n    async function executePriceCheck(query) {\n      const container = document.getElementById('priceComparisonArea');\n      const searchBtn = document.getElementById('priceSearchBtn');\n\n      if (searchBtn) {\n        searchBtn.disabled = true;\n        searchBtn.innerHTML = '<span class=\"spinner-border spinner-border-sm me-2\"></span>Searching...';\n      }\n\n      container.innerHTML = `\n        <div class=\"text-center py-5\">\n          <div class=\"spinner-border text-primary\" role=\"status\"></div>\n          <p class=\"text-muted mt-2\">Checking prices across verified pharmacies...</p>\n        </div>\n      `;\n\n      try {\n        const res = await fetch(`/api/inventory/compare?query=${encodeURIComponent(query)}`);\n        const data = await res.json();\n\n        if (!data.success || !data.matchFound) {\n          container.innerHTML = `\n            <div class=\"alert alert-warning border-0 p-4 shadow-sm text-center\">\n              <i class=\"fas fa-exclamation-triangle fa-2x mb-2 text-warning\"></i>\n              <h5 class=\"fw-bold\">No Medicine Found</h5>\n              <p class=\"text-muted mb-0\">No matching medicine found for \"${query}\". Try searching for popular brands like Napa, Seclo, or Maxpro.</p>\n            </div>\n          `;\n          return;\n        }\n\n        const { medicine, lowestPrice, data: items } = data;\n\n        let rowsHtml = '<tr><td colspan=\"6\" class=\"text-center py-4 text-muted\">No pharmacies have listed current inventory for this medicine yet.</td></tr>';\n        if (items && items.length > 0) {\n          rowsHtml = items.map(item => {\n            const isLowest = item.price === lowestPrice;\n            const diff = item.priceDifference;\n            let diffBadge = '<span class=\"badge bg-secondary\">Matches Ref</span>';\n            if (diff > 0) {\n              diffBadge = `<span class=\"badge bg-danger-subtle text-danger border border-danger-subtle\">+৳${diff.toFixed(2)} (+${item.priceDifferencePercentage}%)</span>`;\n            } else if (diff < 0) {\n              diffBadge = `<span class=\"badge bg-success-subtle text-success border border-success-subtle\">-৳${Math.abs(diff).toFixed(2)} (${item.priceDifferencePercentage}%)</span>`;\n            }\n\n            return `\n              <tr class=\"${isLowest ? 'table-success bg-opacity-25' : ''}\">\n                <td>\n                  <a href=\"pharmacy-details.html?id=${item.pharmacy.id}\" class=\"fw-bold text-dark text-decoration-none\">\n                    ${item.pharmacy.name}\n                  </a>\n                  ${item.pharmacy.verified ? '<i class=\"fas fa-check-circle text-success small ms-1\" title=\"Verified Pharmacy\"></i>' : ''}\n                  <div class=\"small text-muted\"><i class=\"fas fa-map-marker-alt text-danger me-1\"></i>${item.pharmacy.area}</div>\n                </td>\n                <td>\n                  <span class=\"fs-5 fw-bold text-navy\">${formatBDT(item.price)}</span>\n                  ${isLowest ? '<span class=\"badge bg-success ms-2\"><i class=\"fas fa-star me-1\"></i>Lowest Price</span>' : ''}\n                </td>\n                <td>${diffBadge}</td>\n                <td>\n                  <span class=\"badge ${item.status === 'Available' ? 'bg-success' : (item.status === 'Low Stock' ? 'bg-warning text-dark' : 'bg-danger')}\">\n                    ${item.status}\n                  </span>\n                </td>\n                <td class=\"small text-muted\">${formatDate(item.updatedAt)}</td>\n                <td class=\"text-end\">\n                  <a href=\"pharmacy-details.html?id=${item.pharmacy.id}\" class=\"btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm py-1\">\n                    View Stock\n                  </a>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n            `;\n          }).join('');\n        }\n\n        container.innerHTML = `\n          <div class=\"card-custom p-4 mb-4\">\n            <!-- Medicine Info Banner -->\n            <div class=\"row align-items-center mb-4 border-bottom pb-3 g-3\">\n              <div class=\"col-md-7\">\n                <span class=\"badge bg-primary-subtle text-primary fw-bold text-uppercase mb-1\">${medicine.dosageForm}</span>\n                <h3 class=\"fw-bold text-navy mb-1\">${medicine.name}</h3>\n                <div class=\"text-secondary\">${medicine.genericName} • ${medicine.strength}</div>\n                <div class=\"small text-muted\">Manufacturer: <strong>${medicine.manufacturer}</strong></div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"col-md-5 text-md-end\">\n                <div class=\"p-3 bg-light rounded-3 d-inline-block text-start text-md-end\">\n                  <div class=\"small text-muted\">DGDA Official Reference Benchmark</div>\n                  <div class=\"fs-3 fw-bold text-primary\">${formatBDT(medicine.referencePrice)}</div>\n                  <div class=\"small text-success fw-bold\">\n                    ${lowestPrice ? `Lowest available in store: ${formatBDT(lowestPrice)}` : ''}\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Price Table -->\n            <h5 class=\"fw-bold text-navy mb-3\"><i class=\"fas fa-store text-primary me-2\"></i>Pharmacy Price Comparison</h5>\n            <div class=\"table-responsive\">\n              <table class=\"table table-custom align-middle mb-0\">\n                <thead>\n                  <tr>\n                    <th>Pharmacy & Location</th>\n                    <th>Selling Price</th>\n                    <th>Variance vs Ref</th>\n                    <th>Availability</th>\n                    <th>Updated</th>\n                    <th class=\"text-end\">Action</th>\n                  </tr>\n                </thead>\n                <tbody>\n                  ${rowsHtml}\n                </tbody>\n              </table>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        `;\n      } catch (err) {\n        container.innerHTML = `<div class=\"alert alert-danger\">${err.message}</div>`;\n      } finally {\n        if (searchBtn) {\n          searchBtn.disabled = false;\n          searchBtn.innerHTML = '<i class=\"fas fa-search me-2\"></i>Check Prices';\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>\n","Description":"Create Medicine Price Check page (price.html) with comparison table and lowest price highlight","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\User\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\medcheck-bd\\client\\price.html","toolAction":"Create client/price.html","toolSummary":"Create price.html"}}]}
{"step_index":96,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-10T13:00:01Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-10T19:00:01+06:00\nCompleted At: 2026-09-10T19:00:02+06:00\nCreated file file:///C:/Users/User/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/medcheck-bd/client/price.html with requested content.\nIf relevant, proactively run terminal commands to execute this code for the USER. Don't ask for permission."}
{"step_index":97,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-10T13:00:02Z","thinking":"**Designing the Pharmacy Listing Page**\n\nConstructing the `pharmacies.html` file to display verified pharmacy information, it should include a clear heading and search functionalities. The page will present pharmacy cards with details like name, verification status, address, contact information, operating hours, available medicines, and action buttons.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Find Verified Pharmacies - MedCheck BD</title>\n  <link href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <link href=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"css/style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <!-- Dynamic Navbar -->\n  <div id=\"mainNavbar\"></div>\n\n  <main class=\"py-5\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <!-- Header -->\n      <div class=\"text-center max-w-700 mx-auto mb-5\">\n        <span class=\"badge bg-info bg-opacity-10 text-info fw-bold text-uppercase px-3 py-2 rounded-pill mb-2\">\n          <i class=\"fas fa-certificate me-1\"></i> Verified Pharmacy Network\n        </span>\n        <h1 class=\"fw-bold text-navy\">Find a Verified Pharmacy</h1>\n        <p class=\"text-muted\">\n          Search authorized pharmacies across Dhaka and major Bangladeshi divisions holding authenticated DGDA drug licenses and real-time inventory.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Filters Card -->\n      <div class=\"card-custom p-4 mb-5\">\n        <div class=\"row g-3 align-items-end\">\n          <div class=\"col-md-4\">\n            <label class=\"form-label fw-bold text-navy small\">Select Area / Hub</label>\n            <select id=\"filterArea\" class=\"form-select\" onchange=\"loadPharmacies()\">\n              <option value=\"All Areas\">All Areas (Bangladesh)</option>\n              <option value=\"Dhanmondi\">Dhanmondi, Dhaka</option>\n              <option value=\"Mirpur\">Mirpur, Dhaka</option>\n              <option value=\"Uttara\">Uttara, Dhaka</option>\n              <option value=\"Mohammadpur\">Mohammadpur, Dhaka</option>\n              <option value=\"Gulshan\">Gulshan, Dhaka</option>\n              <option value=\"Banani\">Banani, Dhaka</option>\n              <option value=\"Chittagong\">Chittagong Division</option>\n              <option value=\"Sylhet\">Sylhet Division</option>\n              <option value=\"Rajshahi\">Rajshahi Division</option>\n            </select>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"col-md-4\">\n            <label class=\"form-label fw-bold text-navy small\">Filter by Available Medicine</label>\n            <div class=\"input-group\">\n              <span class=\"input-group-text bg-white\"><i class=\"fas fa-pills text-muted\"></i></span>\n              <input\n                type=\"text\"\n                id=\"filterMedicine\"\n                class=\"form-control\"\n                placeholder=\"e.g. Napa, Seclo, Ace...\"\n                onkeyup=\"if(event.key==='Enter') loadPharmacies()\"\n              >\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"col-md-4\">\n            <label class=\"form-label fw-bold text-navy small\">Search Pharmacy Name</label>\n            <div class=\"input-group\">\n              <input\n                type=\"text\"\n                id=\"searchPharmacy\"\n                class=\"form-control\"\n                placeholder=\"e.g. MedCare, Lazz Pharma...\"\n                onkeyup=\"if(event.key==='Enter') loadPharmacies()\"\n              >\n              <button class=\"btn btn-primary-custom\" type=\"button\" onclick=\"loadPharmacies()\">\n                <i class=\"fas fa-search\"></i>\n              </button>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Pharmacy Cards Grid -->\n      <div class=\"row\" id=\"pharmacyList\">\n        <!-- Loaded dynamically via js/pharmacy.js -->\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n\n  <!-- Dynamic Footer -->\n  <div id=\"mainFooter\"></div>\n\n  <!-- Scripts -->\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js\"></script>\n  <script src=\"js/main.js\"></script>\n  <script src=\"js/auth.js\"></script>\n  <script src=\"js/pharmacy.js\"></script>\n  <script>\n    document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n      const urlParams = new URLSearchParams(window.location.search);\n      const med = urlParams.get('medicine');\n      if (med) {\n        const medInput = document.getElementById('filterMedicine');\n        if (medInput) medInput.value = decodeURIComponent(med);\n      }\n      loadPharmacies();\n    });\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>\n","Description":"Create Find Pharmacy page (pharmacies.html) with area filters and live directory","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\User\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\medcheck-bd\\client\\pharmacies.html","toolAction":"Create client/pharmacies.html","toolSummary":"Create pharmacies.html"}}]}
