{"step_index":99,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-10T13:00:10Z","thinking":"**Designing the Pharmacy Details View**\n\nDefine the structure for a new HTML file, `client/pharmacy-details.html`, to display comprehensive pharmacy information. The design requires showing specific data elements including pharmacy name, verification, license, address, contact, hours, management, an inventory summary, and a medicine stock table. The table needs detailed columns for medicine, batch, quantity, expiry, price, and availability status.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Pharmacy Profile & Inventory - MedCheck BD</title>\n  <link href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <link href=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"css/style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <!-- Dynamic Navbar -->\n  <div id=\"mainNavbar\"></div>\n\n  <main class=\"py-5\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <!-- Breadcrumb -->\n      <nav aria-label=\"breadcrumb\" class=\"mb-4\">\n        <ol class=\"breadcrumb\">\n          <li class=\"breadcrumb-item\"><a href=\"index.html\">Home</a></li>\n          <li class=\"breadcrumb-item\"><a href=\"pharmacies.html\">Pharmacies</a></li>\n          <li class=\"breadcrumb-item active\" aria-current=\"page\">Pharmacy Profile</li>\n        </ol>\n      </nav>\n\n      <!-- Pharmacy Info Card -->\n      <div id=\"pharmacyProfileArea\">\n        <div class=\"text-center py-4\">\n          <div class=\"spinner-border text-primary\" role=\"status\"></div>\n          <p class=\"text-muted mt-2\">Loading pharmacy profile...</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Live Stock & Inventory Table -->\n      <div class=\"card-custom p-4 mb-5\">\n        <div class=\"d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-between align-items-center mb-4 gap-2\">\n          <div>\n            <h4 class=\"fw-bold text-navy mb-1\"><i class=\"fas fa-boxes text-primary me-2\"></i>Live Medicine Inventory</h4>\n            <p class=\"text-muted small mb-0\">Real-time stock verified and published by this pharmacy.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"d-flex gap-2\">\n            <span class=\"status-pill instock small\"><i class=\"fas fa-circle small me-1\"></i> In Stock</span>\n            <span class=\"status-pill lowstock small\"><i class=\"fas fa-circle small me-1\"></i> Low Stock (&lt;10)</span>\n            <span class=\"status-pill expired small\"><i class=\"fas fa-circle small me-1\"></i> Out of Stock / Expired</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"table-responsive\">\n          <table class=\"table table-custom align-middle mb-0\">\n            <thead>\n              <tr>\n                <th>Medicine & Generic</th>\n                <th>Dosage Form</th>\n                <th>Batch Number</th>\n                <th>Stock Quantity</th>\n                <th>Expiry Date</th>\n                <th>Retail Price</th>\n                <th>Availability</th>\n              </tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody id=\"stockTableBody\">\n              <!-- Loaded dynamically via js/pharmacy.js -->\n            </tbody>\n          </table>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n\n  <!-- Dynamic Footer -->\n  <div id=\"mainFooter\"></div>\n\n  <!-- Scripts -->\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js\"></script>\n  <script src=\"js/main.js\"></script>\n  <script src=\"js/auth.js\"></script>\n  <script src=\"js/pharmacy.js\"></script>\n  <script>\n    document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n      loadPharmacyDetails();\n    });\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>\n","Description":"Create Pharmacy Details page (pharmacy-details.html) with profile and live stock table","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\User\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\medcheck-bd\\client\\pharmacy-details.html","toolAction":"Create client/pharmacy-details.html","toolSummary":"Create pharmacy-details.html"}}]}
{"step_index":100,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-10T13:00:16Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-10T19:00:16+06:00\nCompleted At: 2026-09-10T19:00:16+06:00\nCreated file file:///C:/Users/User/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/medcheck-bd/client/pharmacy-details.html with requested content.\nIf relevant, proactively run terminal commands to execute this code for the USER. Don't ask for permission."}
{"step_index":101,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-10T13:00:16Z","thinking":"**Designing Authentication Pages**\n\nThe authentication system requires three pages. A unified login page will support Customer, Pharmacy, and Admin roles, featuring demo login buttons for easy testing of each role and redirecting to respective dashboards upon successful authentication. Another page will handle customer registration with fields for essential information, while a separate dedicated registration page is needed for pharmacies.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Login - MedCheck BD</title>\n  <link href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <link href=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"css/style.css\">\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-light\">\n\n  <!-- Dynamic Navbar -->\n  <div id=\"mainNavbar\"></div>\n\n  <main class=\"py-5\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"card-custom p-4 p-md-5 mx-auto\" style=\"max-width: 520px;\">\n        <div class=\"text-center mb-4\">\n          <div class=\"brand-icon mx-auto mb-3\" style=\"width: 50px; height: 50px; font-size: 1.5rem;\">\n            <i class=\"fas fa-shield-alt\"></i>\n          </div>\n          <h3 class=\"fw-bold text-navy\">Welcome to MedCheck BD</h3>\n          <p class=\"text-muted small\">Sign in to your Customer, Pharmacy, or Admin account</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Quick Fill Demo Bar -->\n        <div class=\"p-3 bg-light rounded-3 border mb-4\">\n          <span class=\"small fw-bold text-muted d-block mb-2 text-center\">\n            <i class=\"fas fa-bolt text-warning me-1\"></i> 1-Click Demo Accounts:\n          </span>\n          <div class=\"d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 justify-content-center\">\n            <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm\" onclick=\"quickFillLogin('customer')\">\n              <i class=\"fas fa-user me-1\"></i> Customer\n            </button>\n            <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-outline-success btn-sm\" onclick=\"quickFillLogin('pharmacy')\">\n              <i class=\"fas fa-store me-1\"></i> Pharmacy\n            </button>\n            <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-outline-danger btn-sm\" onclick=\"quickFillLogin('admin')\">\n              <i class=\"fas fa-user-shield me-1\"></i> Admin\n            </button>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <form onsubmit=\"handleLogin(event)\">\n          <div class=\"mb-3\">\n            <label class=\"form-label fw-bold text-navy small\">Email Address</label>\n            <div class=\"input-group\">\n              <span class=\"input-group-text bg-white\"><i class=\"fas fa-envelope text-muted\"></i></span>\n              <input type=\"email\" id=\"loginEmail\" class=\"form-control\" placeholder=\"e.g. customer@gmail.com\" required>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"mb-4\">\n            <label class=\"form-label fw-bold text-navy small\">Password</label>\n            <div class=\"input-group\">\n              <span class=\"input-group-text bg-white\"><i class=\"fas fa-lock text-muted\"></i></span>\n              <input type=\"password\" id=\"loginPassword\" class=\"form-control\" placeholder=\"••••••••\" required>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <button type=\"submit\" id=\"loginBtn\" class=\"btn btn-primary-custom w-100 py-2 mb-3\">\n            <i class=\"fas fa-sign-in-alt me-2\"></i>Sign In\n          </button>\n        </form>\n\n        <div class=\"text-center pt-3 border-top small text-muted\">\n          Don't have an account? <a href=\"register.html\" class=\"fw-bold text-primary\">Register as Customer</a><br>\n          Are you a licensed pharmacy? <a href=\"pharmacy-register.html\" class=\"fw-bold text-success\">Register Pharmacy</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n\n  <!-- Dynamic Footer -->\n  <div id=\"mainFooter\"></div>\n\n  <!-- Scripts -->\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js\"></script>\n  <script src=\"js/main.js\"></script>\n  <script src=\"js/auth.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>\n","Description":"Create Login page (login.html) with 1-click demo login buttons for all 3 roles","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\User\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\medcheck-bd\\client\\login.html","toolAction":"Create client/login.html","toolSummary":"Create login.html"}}]}
{"step_index":102,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-10T13:00:21Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-10T19:00:21+06:00\nCompleted At: 2026-09-10T19:00:22+06:00\nCreated file file:///C:/Users/User/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/medcheck-bd/client/login.html with requested content.\nIf relevant, proactively run terminal commands to execute this code for the USER. Don't ask for permission."}
{"step_index":103,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-10T13:00:22Z","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Customer Registration - MedCheck BD</title>\n  <link href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <link href=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"css/style.css\">\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-light\">\n\n  <!-- Dynamic Navbar -->\n  <div id=\"mainNavbar\"></div>\n\n  <main class=\"py-5\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"card-custom p-4 p-md-5 mx-auto\" style=\"max-width: 560px;\">\n        <div class=\"text-center mb-4\">\n          <div class=\"brand-icon mx-auto mb-3\" style=\"width: 50px; height: 50px; font-size: 1.5rem;\">\n            <i class=\"fas fa-user-plus\"></i>\n          </div>\n          <h3 class=\"fw-bold text-navy\">Create Customer Account</h3>\n          <p class=\"text-muted small\">Access personal medicine history, price alerts, and digital purchase receipts</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <form onsubmit=\"handleRegister(event)\">\n          <div class=\"mb-3\">\n            <label class=\"form-label fw-bold text-navy small\">Full Name</label>\n            <div class=\"input-group\">\n              <span class=\"input-group-text bg-white\"><i class=\"fas fa-user text-muted\"></i></span>\n              <input type=\"text\" id=\"regName\" class=\"form-control\" placeholder=\"e.g. Shakil Mahmud\" required>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"mb-3\">\n            <label class=\"form-label fw-bold text-navy small\">Email Address</label>\n            <div class=\"input-group\">\n              <span class=\"input-group-text bg-white\"><i class=\"fas fa-envelope text-muted\"></i></span>\n              <input type=\"email\" id=\"regEmail\" class=\"form-control\" placeholder=\"e.g. shakil@gmail.com\" required>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"mb-3\">\n            <label class=\"form-label fw-bold text-navy small\">Phone Number (Bangladesh)</label>\n            <div class=\"input-group\">\n              <span class=\"input-group-text bg-white\">+880</span>\n              <input type=\"tel\" id=\"regPhone\" class=\"form-control\" placeholder=\"1711000000\" required>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"row g-3 mb-4\">\n            <div class=\"col-md-6\">\n              <label class=\"form-label fw-bold text-navy small\">Password</label>\n              <div class=\"input-group\">\n                <span class=\"input-group-text bg-white\"><i class=\"fas fa-lock text-muted\"></i></span>\n                <input type=\"password\" id=\"regPassword\" class=\"form-control\" placeholder=\"••••••••\" minlength=\"6\" required>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-md-6\">\n              <label class=\"form-label fw-bold text-navy small\">Confirm Password</label>\n              <div class=\"input-group\">\n                <span class=\"input-group-text bg-white\"><i class=\"fas fa-lock text-muted\"></i></span>\n                <input type=\"password\" id=\"regConfirmPassword\" class=\"form-control\" placeholder=\"••••••••\" minlength=\"6\" required>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <button type=\"submit\" id=\"registerBtn\" class=\"btn btn-primary-custom w-100 py-2 mb-3\">\n            <i class=\"fas fa-user-plus me-2\"></i>Create Customer Account\n          </button>\n        </form>\n\n        <div class=\"text-center pt-3 border-top small text-muted\">\n          Already registered? <a href=\"login.html\" class=\"fw-bold text-primary\">Login here</a><br>\n          Are you a pharmacy owner? <a href=\"pharmacy-register.html\" class=\"fw-bold text-success\">Register your Pharmacy</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n\n  <!-- Dynamic Footer -->\n  <div id=\"mainFooter\"></div>\n\n  <!-- Scripts -->\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js\"></script>\n  <script src=\"js/main.js\"></script>\n  <script src=\"js/auth.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>\n","Description":"Create Customer Registration page (register.html)","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\User\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\medcheck-bd\\client\\register.html","toolAction":"Create client/register.html","toolSummary":"Create register.html"}}]}
