{"step_index":105,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-10T13:00:29Z","thinking":"**Designing the Pharmacy Registration Form**\n\nThe task is to design an HTML form for pharmacy registration. Key fields include pharmacy name, owner name, contact details (phone, email, address), geographical location (area, division), license/reference number, and a password for secure access. The status of a new pharmacy should be initialized to \"Pending Verification,\" and an administrator will handle approval or rejection.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Pharmacy Partner Registration - MedCheck BD</title>\n  <link href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <link href=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"css/style.css\">\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-light\">\n\n  <!-- Dynamic Navbar -->\n  <div id=\"mainNavbar\"></div>\n\n  <main class=\"py-5\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"card-custom p-4 p-md-5 mx-auto\" style=\"max-width: 680px;\">\n        <div class=\"text-center mb-4\">\n          <div class=\"brand-icon mx-auto mb-3\" style=\"width: 54px; height: 54px; font-size: 1.6rem; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #059669, #10b981);\">\n            <i class=\"fas fa-clinic-medical\"></i>\n          </div>\n          <h3 class=\"fw-bold text-navy\">Pharmacy Partner Registration</h3>\n          <p class=\"text-muted small\">\n            Join the verified MedCheck BD pharmacy directory. Publish medicine availability, record compliant sales, and gain consumer trust.\n          </p>\n          <div class=\"alert alert-info py-2 small border-0\">\n            <i class=\"fas fa-shield-alt me-1\"></i> New registrations start with <strong>Pending Verification</strong> status until DGDA license inspection by Admin.\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <form onsubmit=\"handlePharmacyRegister(event)\">\n          <div class=\"row g-3 mb-3\">\n            <div class=\"col-md-6\">\n              <label class=\"form-label fw-bold text-navy small\">Pharmacy Trade Name</label>\n              <input type=\"text\" id=\"pharmacyName\" class=\"form-control\" placeholder=\"e.g. HealthCare Drug House\" required>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-md-6\">\n              <label class=\"form-label fw-bold text-navy small\">Owner / Pharmacist Name</label>\n              <input type=\"text\" id=\"ownerName\" class=\"form-control\" placeholder=\"e.g. Faruk Hossain\" required>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"row g-3 mb-3\">\n            <div class=\"col-md-6\">\n              <label class=\"form-label fw-bold text-navy small\">Official Email Address</label>\n              <input type=\"email\" id=\"pharmacyEmail\" class=\"form-control\" placeholder=\"pharmacy@store.com\" required>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-md-6\">\n              <label class=\"form-label fw-bold text-navy small\">Mobile / Hotline</label>\n              <input type=\"tel\" id=\"pharmacyPhone\" class=\"form-control\" placeholder=\"+880 1711-000000\" required>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"row g-3 mb-3\">\n            <div class=\"col-md-6\">\n              <label class=\"form-label fw-bold text-navy small\">DGDA Drug License Number</label>\n              <input type=\"text\" id=\"licenseNumber\" class=\"form-control font-monospace\" placeholder=\"e.g. DL-DHK-2024-8891\" required>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-md-6\">\n              <label class=\"form-label fw-bold text-navy small\">Daily Operating Hours</label>\n              <input type=\"text\" id=\"openingHours\" class=\"form-control\" placeholder=\"e.g. 8:00 AM - 11:30 PM or 24 Hours\">\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"row g-3 mb-3\">\n            <div class=\"col-md-6\">\n              <label class=\"form-label fw-bold text-navy small\">Area / Hub</label>\n              <select id=\"pharmacyArea\" class=\"form-select\" required>\n                <option value=\"Dhanmondi\">Dhanmondi</option>\n                <option value=\"Mirpur\">Mirpur</option>\n                <option value=\"Uttara\">Uttara</option>\n                <option value=\"Mohammadpur\">Mohammadpur</option>\n                <option value=\"Gulshan\">Gulshan</option>\n                <option value=\"Banani\">Banani</option>\n                <option value=\"Badda\">Badda</option>\n                <option value=\"Motijheel\">Motijheel</option>\n                <option value=\"Chittagong\">Chittagong</option>\n                <option value=\"Sylhet\">Sylhet</option>\n                <option value=\"Rajshahi\">Rajshahi</option>\n              </select>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-md-6\">\n              <label class=\"form-label fw-bold text-navy small\">Division</label>\n              <select id=\"pharmacyDivision\" class=\"form-select\" required>\n                <option value=\"Dhaka\">Dhaka Division</option>\n                <option value=\"Chittagong\">Chittagong Division</option>\n                <option value=\"Sylhet\">Sylhet Division</option>\n                <option value=\"Rajshahi\">Rajshahi Division</option>\n              </select>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"mb-3\">\n            <label class=\"form-label fw-bold text-navy small\">Detailed Physical Address</label>\n            <input type=\"text\" id=\"pharmacyAddress\" class=\"form-control\" placeholder=\"Shop #12, Road #4, Sector #3...\" required>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"mb-4\">\n            <label class=\"form-label fw-bold text-navy small\">Set Account Password</label>\n            <input type=\"password\" id=\"pharmacyPassword\" class=\"form-control\" placeholder=\"••••••••\" minlength=\"6\" required>\n          </div>\n\n          <button type=\"submit\" id=\"pharmacyRegBtn\" class=\"btn btn-success-custom w-100 py-2 mb-3\">\n            <i class=\"fas fa-store me-2\"></i>Register Pharmacy Application\n          </button>\n        </form>\n\n        <div class=\"text-center pt-3 border-top small text-muted\">\n          Already registered? <a href=\"login.html\" class=\"fw-bold text-primary\">Login to Pharmacy Portal</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n\n  <!-- Dynamic Footer -->\n  <div id=\"mainFooter\"></div>\n\n  <!-- Scripts -->\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js\"></script>\n  <script src=\"js/main.js\"></script>\n  <script src=\"js/auth.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>\n","Description":"Create Pharmacy Registration onboarding page (pharmacy-register.html)","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\User\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\medcheck-bd\\client\\pharmacy-register.html","toolAction":"Create client/pharmacy-register.html","toolSummary":"Create pharmacy-register.html"}}]}
{"step_index":106,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-10T13:00:36Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-10T19:00:36+06:00\nCompleted At: 2026-09-10T19:00:36+06:00\nCreated file file:///C:/Users/User/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/medcheck-bd/client/pharmacy-register.html with requested content.\nIf relevant, proactively run terminal commands to execute this code for the USER. Don't ask for permission."}
{"step_index":107,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-10T13:00:36Z","thinking":"**Designing the Customer Dashboard**\n\nThe objective is to structure the customer dashboard HTML. It must include cards for medicines checked, saved items, recent searches, and pharmacies. Sections for recent checks, saved items, medicine alerts, and purchase history are also required. Quick action buttons will allow for medicine verification, pharmacy searches, price checks, and reporting.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Customer Dashboard - MedCheck BD</title>\n  <link href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <link href=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"css/style.css\">\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-light\">\n\n  <!-- Dynamic Navbar -->\n  <div id=\"mainNavbar\"></div>\n\n  <main class=\"py-5\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <!-- Header Banner -->\n      <div class=\"d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-between align-items-center mb-4 gap-3\">\n        <div>\n          <h2 class=\"fw-bold text-navy mb-1\" id=\"custWelcomeName\">Welcome, Customer</h2>\n          <p class=\"text-muted small mb-0\">Your personal healthcare medicine verification and purchase activity hub.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"d-flex gap-2\">\n          <a href=\"verify.html\" class=\"btn btn-primary-custom btn-sm\">\n            <i class=\"fas fa-shield-alt me-1\"></i> Verify Medicine\n          </a>\n          <a href=\"report.html\" class=\"btn btn-outline-danger btn-sm\">\n            <i class=\"fas fa-flag me-1\"></i> Report Suspicious Batch\n          </a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Quick KPI Cards -->\n      <div class=\"row g-3 mb-4\">\n        <div class=\"col-lg-3 col-sm-6\">\n          <div class=\"card-custom p-3 bg-white\">\n            <div class=\"d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between\">\n              <div>\n                <span class=\"text-muted small fw-bold\">Medicines Checked</span>\n                <h3 class=\"fw-bold text-navy mb-0 mt-1\" id=\"statCustChecked\">0</h3>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"rounded-circle bg-primary bg-opacity-10 text-primary p-3\">\n                <i class=\"fas fa-check-double fa-lg\"></i>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"col-lg-3 col-sm-6\">\n          <div class=\"card-custom p-3 bg-white\">\n            <div class=\"d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between\">\n              <div>\n                <span class=\"text-muted small fw-bold\">Digital Purchases</span>\n                <h3 class=\"fw-bold text-navy mb-0 mt-1\" id=\"statCustPurchases\">0</h3>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"rounded-circle bg-success bg-opacity-10 text-success p-3\">\n                <i class=\"fas fa-receipt fa-lg\"></i>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"col-lg-3 col-sm-6\">\n          <div class=\"card-custom p-3 bg-white\">\n            <div class=\"d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between\">\n              <div>\n                <span class=\"text-muted small fw-bold\">Reports Filed</span>\n                <h3 class=\"fw-bold text-navy mb-0 mt-1\" id=\"statCustReports\">0</h3>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"rounded-circle bg-danger bg-opacity-10 text-danger p-3\">\n                <i class=\"fas fa-bullhorn fa-lg\"></i>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"col-lg-3 col-sm-6\">\n          <div class=\"card-custom p-3 bg-white\">\n            <div class=\"d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between\">\n              <div>\n                <span class=\"text-muted small fw-bold\">Verified Stores</span>\n                <h3 class=\"fw-bold text-navy mb-0 mt-1\">10+</h3>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"rounded-circle bg-info bg-opacity-10 text-info p-3\">\n                <i class=\"fas fa-clinic-medical fa-lg\"></i>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Quick Action Buttons Bar -->\n      <div class=\"card-custom p-3 mb-4 bg-white\">\n        <div class=\"d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-between align-items-center gap-2\">\n          <span class=\"fw-bold text-navy small\"><i class=\"fas fa-bolt text-warning me-1\"></i> Quick Consumer Actions:</span>\n          <div class=\"d-flex flex-wrap gap-2\">\n            <a href=\"verify.html\" class=\"btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm\"><i class=\"fas fa-search me-1\"></i> Verify Medicine</a>\n            <a href=\"price.html\" class=\"btn btn-outline-success btn-sm\"><i class=\"fas fa-tags me-1\"></i> Check Prices</a>\n            <a href=\"pharmacies.html\" class=\"btn btn-outline-info btn-sm\"><i class=\"fas fa-store me-1\"></i> Find Pharmacy</a>\n            <a href=\"report.html\" class=\"btn btn-outline-danger btn-sm\"><i class=\"fas fa-flag me-1\"></i> Report Medicine</a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"row g-4\">\n        <!-- Recent Medicine Verifications & Purchases -->\n        <div class=\"col-lg-8\">\n          <div class=\"card-custom p-4 bg-white mb-4\">\n            <div class=\"d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center mb-3\">\n              <h5 class=\"fw-bold text-navy mb-0\"><i class=\"fas fa-history text-primary me-2\"></i>Recent Medicine Activity</h5>\n              <a href=\"history.html\" class=\"small fw-bold text-primary text-decoration-none\">Full History &rarr;</a>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"table-responsive\">\n              <table class=\"table table-custom align-middle mb-0\">\n                <thead>\n                  <tr>\n                    <th>Medicine</th>\n                    <th>Batch</th>\n                    <th>Activity Type</th>\n                    <th>Status</th>\n                    <th>Date</th>\n                  </tr>\n                </thead>\n                <tbody id=\"custRecentActivityBody\">\n                  <tr><td colspan=\"5\" class=\"text-center py-4 text-muted\">Loading your activity...</td></tr>\n                </tbody>\n              </table>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Digital Purchases & Receipts -->\n          <div class=\"card-custom p-4 bg-white\">\n            <div class=\"d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center mb-3\">\n              <h5 class=\"fw-bold text-navy mb-0\"><i class=\"fas fa-file-invoice-dollar text-success me-2\"></i>Linked Purchase Receipts</h5>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"table-responsive\">\n              <table class=\"table table-custom align-middle mb-0\">\n                <thead>\n                  <tr>\n                    <th>Receipt ID</th>\n                    <th>Pharmacy</th>\n                    <th>Amount</th>\n                    <th>Date</th>\n                    <th>Receipt</th>\n                  </tr>\n                </thead>\n                <tbody id=\"custReceiptsBody\">\n                  <tr><td colspan=\"5\" class=\"text-center py-3 text-muted\">No sales linked yet. Purchases recorded by pharmacies with your phone appear here.</td></tr>\n                </tbody>\n              </table>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Right Side: Health Alerts & Safety Advisories -->\n        <div class=\"col-lg-4\">\n          <div class=\"card-custom p-4 bg-white mb-4\">\n            <h5 class=\"fw-bold text-navy mb-3\"><i class=\"fas fa-bell text-danger me-2\"></i>Active Public Alerts</h5>\n            \n            <div class=\"alert alert-danger p-3 mb-3 border-0 small\">\n              <div class=\"fw-bold mb-1\"><i class=\"fas fa-exclamation-triangle me-1\"></i> Packaging Discrepancy Alert</div>\n              Batch <strong>ACE-FLAG-88</strong> (Ace Plus) reported in Dhaka Mirpur circle for uneven foil print. Verify batch prior to dispensing.\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"alert alert-warning p-3 mb-3 border-0 small\">\n              <div class=\"fw-bold mb-1\"><i class=\"fas fa-clock me-1\"></i> Near Expiry Batch Warning</div>\n              Batch <strong>NAPA-EXP-26</strong> (Napa 500 mg) approaches 30-day expiry threshold.\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"alert alert-info p-3 mb-0 border-0 small\">\n              <div class=\"fw-bold mb-1\"><i class=\"fas fa-shield-alt me-1\"></i> Patient Tip</div>\n              Always compare pharmacy price with the reference price on <a href=\"price.html\" class=\"fw-bold\">Price Check</a> to ensure fair pricing.\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n\n  <!-- Dynamic Footer -->\n  <div id=\"mainFooter\"></div>\n\n  <!-- Scripts -->\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js\"></script>\n  <script src=\"js/main.js\"></script>\n  <script src=\"js/auth.js\"></script>\n  <script>\n    document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', async () => {\n      if (!enforceRoleGuard(['customer', 'admin'])) return;\n\n      const user = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('user') || '{}');\n      if (user.name) {\n        document.getElementById('custWelcomeName').textContent = `Welcome, ${user.name}`;\n      }\n\n      await loadCustomerDashboardData();\n    });\n\n    async function loadCustomerDashboardData() {\n      try {\n        // 1. Load History\n        const histRes = await fetch('/api/history', { headers: getAuthHeaders() });\n        const histData = await histRes.json();\n        const history = histData.data || [];\n\n        const verifications = history.filter(h => h.type === 'VERIFICATION');\n        const purchases = history.filter(h => h.type === 'PURCHASE');\n\n        document.getElementById('statCustChecked').textContent = verifications.length;\n        document.getElementById('statCustPurchases').textContent = purchases.length;\n\n        const histBody = document.getElementById('custRecentActivityBody');\n        if (history.length === 0) {\n          histBody.innerHTML = '<tr><td colspan=\"5\" class=\"text-center py-4 text-muted\">No recent activity. Try verifying a medicine!</td></tr>';\n        } else {\n          histBody.innerHTML = history.slice(0, 5).map(h => `\n            <tr>\n              <td>\n                <strong class=\"text-navy\">${h.medicineName}</strong>\n                <div class=\"small text-muted\">${h.genericName || ''}</div>\n              </td>\n              <td class=\"font-monospace small\">${h.batchNumber || 'N/A'}</td>\n              <td><span class=\"badge ${h.type === 'PURCHASE' ? 'bg-success' : 'bg-primary'}\">${h.type}</span></td>\n              <td><span class=\"status-pill match\">${h.verificationStatus}</span></td>\n              <td class=\"small text-muted\">${formatDate(h.checkedAt)}</td>\n            </tr>\n          `).join('');\n        }\n\n        // 2. Load Reports count\n        const rptRes = await fetch('/api/reports', { headers: getAuthHeaders() });\n        const rptData = await rptRes.json();\n        document.getElementById('statCustReports').textContent = rptData.count || 0;\n\n        // 3. Load Sales / Receipts\n        const salesRes = await fetch('/api/sales', { headers: getAuthHeaders() });\n        const salesData = await salesRes.json();\n        const receipts = salesData.data || [];\n\n        const receiptsBody = document.getElementById('custReceiptsBody');\n        if (receipts.length === 0) {\n          receiptsBody.innerHTML = '<tr><td colspan=\"5\" class=\"text-center py-3 text-muted\">No digital receipts recorded yet.</td></tr>';\n        } else {\n          receiptsBody.innerHTML = receipts.slice(0, 5).map(s => `\n            <tr>\n              <td class=\"font-monospace fw-bold\">${s.receiptId}</td>\n              <td>${s.pharmacyId ? s.pharmacyId.name : 'Verified Pharmacy'}</td>\n              <td class=\"fw-bold text-success\">${formatBDT(s.totalPrice)}</td>\n              <td class=\"small text-muted\">${formatDate(s.date)}</td>\n              <td>\n                <a href=\"receipt.html?receiptId=${s.receiptId}\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm py-0 px-2\">\n                  <i class=\"fas fa-receipt me-1\"></i> View\n                </a>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          `).join('');\n        }\n      } catch (err) {\n        console.error('Customer dashboard load error', err);\n      }\n    }\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>\n","Description":"Create Customer Dashboard page (customer-dashboard.html)","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\User\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\medcheck-bd\\client\\customer-dashboard.html","toolAction":"Create client/customer-dashboard.html","toolSummary":"Create customer-dashboard.html"}}]}
