{"step_index":113,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-10T13:01:08Z","thinking":"**Designing the customer report form**\n\nThe task involves designing an HTML form for customers to report suspicious medicine instances. The form requires specific fields: medicine name, manufacturer, batch number, pharmacy name, and a problem type selection. The problem type will be a list of options. Finally, a description box is needed.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Report Suspicious Medicine - MedCheck BD</title>\n  <link href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <link href=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"css/style.css\">\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-light\">\n\n  <!-- Dynamic Navbar -->\n  <div id=\"mainNavbar\"></div>\n\n  <main class=\"py-5\">\n    <div class=\"container\" style=\"max-width: 780px;\">\n      <!-- Header -->\n      <div class=\"text-center mb-5\">\n        <span class=\"badge bg-danger bg-opacity-10 text-danger fw-bold text-uppercase px-3 py-2 rounded-pill mb-2\">\n          <i class=\"fas fa-flag me-1\"></i> Community Vigilance\n        </span>\n        <h2 class=\"fw-bold text-navy\">Report a Suspicious Medicine or Pharmacy</h2>\n        <p class=\"text-muted small\">\n          Help protect fellow citizens by reporting suspected counterfeit packaging, scratched expiry dates, exorbitant retail prices, or unregistered batches.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Report Submission Card -->\n      <div class=\"card-custom p-4 p-md-5 bg-white mb-4\" id=\"reportCardArea\">\n        <form onsubmit=\"handleReportSubmit(event)\">\n          <div class=\"row g-3 mb-3\">\n            <div class=\"col-md-6\">\n              <label class=\"form-label fw-bold text-navy small\">Medicine Brand Name *</label>\n              <input type=\"text\" id=\"reportMedName\" class=\"form-control\" placeholder=\"e.g. Ace Plus, Napa...\" required>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-md-6\">\n              <label class=\"form-label fw-bold text-navy small\">Manufacturer (If known)</label>\n              <input type=\"text\" id=\"reportManufacturer\" class=\"form-control\" placeholder=\"e.g. Square, Beximco...\">\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"row g-3 mb-3\">\n            <div class=\"col-md-6\">\n              <label class=\"form-label fw-bold text-navy small\">Batch Number (From Package/Blister)</label>\n              <input type=\"text\" id=\"reportBatchNumber\" class=\"form-control font-monospace\" placeholder=\"e.g. ACE-FLAG-88\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-md-6\">\n              <label class=\"form-label fw-bold text-navy small\">Problem Category *</label>\n              <select id=\"reportIssueType\" class=\"form-select\" required>\n                <option value=\"Suspected Counterfeit\">Suspected Counterfeit</option>\n                <option value=\"Unregistered Medicine\">Unregistered Medicine</option>\n                <option value=\"Wrong Price\">Exorbitant / Wrong Price</option>\n                <option value=\"Expired Medicine\">Expired Medicine Sold</option>\n                <option value=\"Damaged Packaging\">Damaged or Faded Packaging</option>\n                <option value=\"Side Effect Incident\">Unusual Side Effect Incident</option>\n                <option value=\"Other\">Other Discrepancy</option>\n              </select>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"row g-3 mb-3\">\n            <div class=\"col-md-6\">\n              <label class=\"form-label fw-bold text-navy small\">Purchased / Encountered Pharmacy Name</label>\n              <input type=\"text\" id=\"reportPharmacyName\" class=\"form-control\" placeholder=\"e.g. Corner Drugstore\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-md-6\">\n              <label class=\"form-label fw-bold text-navy small\">Pharmacy Location / Area</label>\n              <input type=\"text\" id=\"reportPharmacyLocation\" class=\"form-control\" placeholder=\"e.g. Mirpur 11, Dhaka\">\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"mb-3\">\n            <label class=\"form-label fw-bold text-navy small\">Detailed Incident Description *</label>\n            <textarea\n              id=\"reportDescription\"\n              class=\"form-control\"\n              rows=\"4\"\n              placeholder=\"Describe why this product seems suspicious (e.g. blurry text, unusual tablet smell or color, printed price scratched out, refused receipt)...\"\n              required\n            ></textarea>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Photo Upload UI simulation -->\n          <div class=\"mb-4\">\n            <label class=\"form-label fw-bold text-navy small\">Attach Photo of Medicine / Blister Pack (Optional)</label>\n            <input type=\"file\" id=\"reportPhotoInput\" class=\"form-control\" accept=\"image/*\">\n            <small class=\"text-muted\">Supports JPG, PNG packaging photos for administrative review.</small>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Contact Details (optional/auto-filled) -->\n          <div class=\"p-3 bg-light rounded-3 mb-4\">\n            <h6 class=\"fw-bold text-navy small mb-2\"><i class=\"fas fa-user-shield me-1\"></i> Reporter Contact (Confidential)</h6>\n            <div class=\"row g-2\">\n              <div class=\"col-md-6\">\n                <input type=\"text\" id=\"reportCustName\" class=\"form-control form-control-sm\" placeholder=\"Your Name (or Anonymous)\">\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"col-md-6\">\n                <input type=\"tel\" id=\"reportCustPhone\" class=\"form-control form-control-sm\" placeholder=\"Phone Number for follow-up\">\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <button type=\"submit\" id=\"submitReportBtn\" class=\"btn btn-danger w-100 py-2\">\n            <i class=\"fas fa-paper-plane me-2\"></i>Submit Medicine Report\n          </button>\n        </form>\n\n        <div class=\"alert alert-light border mt-4 mb-0 small text-muted\">\n          <i class=\"fas fa-info-circle text-primary me-1\"></i>\n          <strong>Important Regulatory Disclosure:</strong> MedCheck BD is an information recording platform. Reports are reviewed by system administrators for database warning updates and do not constitute an official DGDA legal finding or physical laboratory test.\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n\n  <!-- Dynamic Footer -->\n  <div id=\"mainFooter\"></div>\n\n  <!-- Scripts -->\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js\"></script>\n  <script src=\"js/main.js\"></script>\n  <script src=\"js/auth.js\"></script>\n  <script>\n    document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n      const urlParams = new URLSearchParams(window.location.search);\n      const med = urlParams.get('medicine');\n      const batch = urlParams.get('batch');\n      const pharmacy = urlParams.get('pharmacy');\n\n      if (med) document.getElementById('reportMedName').value = decodeURIComponent(med);\n      if (batch) document.getElementById('reportBatchNumber').value = decodeURIComponent(batch);\n      if (pharmacy) document.getElementById('reportPharmacyName').value = decodeURIComponent(pharmacy);\n\n      const user = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('user') || 'null');\n      if (user) {\n        if (user.name) document.getElementById('reportCustName').value = user.name;\n        if (user.phone) document.getElementById('reportCustPhone').value = user.phone;\n      }\n    });\n\n    async function handleReportSubmit(e) {\n      e.preventDefault();\n      const medicineName = document.getElementById('reportMedName').value.trim();\n      const manufacturer = document.getElementById('reportManufacturer').value.trim();\n      const batchNumber = document.getElementById('reportBatchNumber').value.trim();\n      const issueType = document.getElementById('reportIssueType').value;\n      const pharmacyName = document.getElementById('reportPharmacyName').value.trim();\n      const pharmacyLocation = document.getElementById('reportPharmacyLocation').value.trim();\n      const description = document.getElementById('reportDescription').value.trim();\n      const customerName = document.getElementById('reportCustName').value.trim();\n      const customerPhone = document.getElementById('reportCustPhone').value.trim();\n      const submitBtn = document.getElementById('submitReportBtn');\n\n      if (!medicineName || !description) {\n        showToast('Please provide medicine name and description', 'warning');\n        return;\n      }\n\n      submitBtn.disabled = true;\n      submitBtn.innerHTML = '<span class=\"spinner-border spinner-border-sm me-2\"></span>Submitting report...';\n\n      try {\n        const token = localStorage.getItem('token');\n        const headers = { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' };\n        if (token) headers.Authorization = `Bearer ${token}`;\n\n        const res = await fetch('/api/reports', {\n          method: 'POST',\n          headers,\n          body: JSON.stringify({\n            medicineName,\n            manufacturer,\n            batchNumber,\n            issueType,\n            pharmacyName,\n            pharmacyLocation,\n            description,\n            customerName,\n            customerPhone,\n          }),\n        });\n\n        const data = await res.json();\n        if (!res.ok) throw new Error(data.message);\n\n        // Render success confirmation card\n        const cardArea = document.getElementById('reportCardArea');\n        cardArea.innerHTML = `\n          <div class=\"text-center py-4\">\n            <div class=\"rounded-circle bg-success bg-opacity-10 text-success d-inline-flex align-items-center justify-content-center p-3 mb-3\" style=\"width: 70px; height: 70px;\">\n              <i class=\"fas fa-check-circle fa-2x\"></i>\n            </div>\n            <h3 class=\"fw-bold text-navy mb-2\">Report Submitted Successfully</h3>\n            <p class=\"text-muted small max-w-500 mx-auto mb-4\">\n              Your report has been received and registered under Reference ID:\n            </p>\n            <div class=\"p-3 bg-light rounded-3 d-inline-block font-monospace fw-bold fs-4 text-primary mb-4 border\">\n              ${data.reportId}\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"alert alert-info small border-0 mb-4 max-w-500 mx-auto\">\n              <strong>Status: Pending Review</strong><br>\n              System administrators will cross-check the batch information. Thank you for making Bangladesh healthcare safer.\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"d-flex justify-content-center gap-2\">\n              <a href=\"index.html\" class=\"btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm\">Return Home</a>\n              <a href=\"verify.html\" class=\"btn btn-primary-custom btn-sm\">Verify Another Medicine</a>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        `;\n\n        showToast(`Report ${data.reportId} submitted`, 'success');\n      } catch (err) {\n        showToast(err.message, 'danger');\n        submitBtn.disabled = false;\n        submitBtn.innerHTML = '<i class=\"fas fa-paper-plane me-2\"></i>Submit Medicine Report';\n      }\n    }\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>\n","Description":"Create Customer Report page (report.html) with tracking ID generation and regulatory notice","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\User\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\medcheck-bd\\client\\report.html","toolAction":"Create client/report.html","toolSummary":"Create report.html"}}]}
