{"step_index":115,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-10T13:01:18Z","thinking":"**Designing the Pharmacy Dashboard**\n\nDeveloping the HTML structure for a pharmacy dashboard, focusing on key features. Considering dashboard cards for quick overviews: total medicines, low stock alerts, soon-to-expire medicines, and daily sales. The main layout will incorporate a live inventory table with medicine management actions and a Point of Sale (POS) system.\nFurthermore, including a medicine alerts panel to display issues such as expired, near-expiry, and flagged batches.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Pharmacy Portal - MedCheck BD</title>\n  <link href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <link href=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"css/style.css\">\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-light\">\n\n  <!-- Dynamic Navbar -->\n  <div id=\"mainNavbar\"></div>\n\n  <main class=\"py-5\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <!-- Header Banner -->\n      <div class=\"d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-between align-items-center mb-4 gap-3\">\n        <div>\n          <h2 class=\"fw-bold text-navy mb-1\" id=\"pharmacyDashboardTitle\">Pharmacy Portal</h2>\n          <p class=\"text-muted small mb-0\">Inventory control, batch expiry tracking, and digital point-of-sale receipt engine.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"d-flex gap-2\">\n          <button class=\"btn btn-success-custom btn-sm\" data-bs-toggle=\"modal\" data-bs-target=\"#recordSaleModal\">\n            <i class=\"fas fa-cash-register me-1\"></i> Record Sale / POS\n          </button>\n          <button class=\"btn btn-primary-custom btn-sm\" data-bs-toggle=\"modal\" data-bs-target=\"#addInventoryModal\">\n            <i class=\"fas fa-plus me-1\"></i> Add Medicine Stock\n          </button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Metric Cards -->\n      <div class=\"row g-3 mb-4